      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-05-22T11:32:40.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: Revenues exceed analysts expectations while EPS lags behind",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹27.76 (up from ₹11.19 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹126.9b (up 73% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹12.0b (up 156% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 9.4% (up from 6.4% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 2.7%. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates by 7.7%. Revenue is forecast to grow 16% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 22% growth forecast for the Real Estate industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 21% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 42% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
