      "title": "PRESTIGE: Metro Station Partnership Will Support Future Real Estate Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target on Prestige Estates Projects slightly to about ₹1,395 from roughly ₹1,406, reflecting updated assumptions on the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E. What's in the News Prestige Group signed a Definitive Agreement with Bangalore Metro Rail Corporation Limited to adopt and co brand Bellandur Metro Station as \"Prestige Bellandur Metro Station\", with an investment of ₹1,150 million over a 30 year concession period for station upgrades and long term partnership rights (Client announcement).",
