      "date": "2026-03-04T18:04:46.000Z",
      "title": "PRESTIGE: Bengaluru Metro Partnership Will Support Future Upside Potential",
      "body": "Analysts have kept their price target for Prestige Estates Projects steady at about ₹1,913 per share, with revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E assumptions unchanged, and only a slightly higher discount rate shaping the latest valuation view. What's in the News Prestige Group signed a Definitive Agreement with Bangalore Metro Rail Corporation Limited to adopt and co brand Bellandur Metro Station as \"Prestige Bellandur Metro Station\", with an investment commitment of ₹1,150 million (excluding GST) over a 30 year concession period, including station upgrades and long term partnership rights (Client announcement).",
