      "body": "Prestige Estates Projects Limited (NSEI:PRESTIGE) acquired Aspire Spaces Tellapur LLP for INR 1 million on February 18, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 1 million will be paid by Prestige Estates Projects Limited. With this acquisition, Aspire Spaces Tellapur LLP has now become wholly owned step-down subsidiary of Prestige Estates Projects Limited.\n\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, Aspire Spaces Tellapur LLP reported total revenue of INR 0.\n\nPrestige Estates Projects Limited (NSEI:PRESTIGE) completed the acquisition of Aspire Spaces Tellapur LLP on February 18, 2026.",
